  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I samband med planeringsfasen inom det bredare samarbetet mellan Statistics Sweden och The Statistical Committee of Russia vg regional statistik, &#xe5;ker tv&#xe5; experter fr&#xe5;n Statistics Sweden till Ryssland f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra LFA-seminarier (april 1999) och tillsammans med den lokala samarbetsparten utarbeta projektdokumentation baserad p&#xe5; LFA-</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the planning phase of the cooperation in the field of regional statistics between the Statistical Committee of Russia and Statistics Sweden, two experts from Statistics Sweden will go to Russia to carry out a LFA-seminar (April 1999) and together with the local counterpart work out project documentation based on LFA principles.</narrative>
  </description>
